  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 — Avalonia 12 compatibility release.\n\n- Retargeted to Avalonia 12.0.0.\n- Fixed System.MissingMethodException on clipboard copy (Ctrl+C / context-menu Copy): IClipboard.SetTextAsync was removed from the interface in Avalonia 12; calls now route through ClipboardExtensions.SetTextAsync (Avalonia.Input.Platform) as required by Avalonia 12.\n- No public API surface changes.\n\nAvalonia 11.x: continue using RichTextViewer.Avalonia 1.x.",
